---
// ChapterProblem.astro - Chapter 1: The Problem
// Tone: A neighbour explaining an uncomfortable reality in plain, everyday English
---

<section id="problem" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-[#F7F5F0] text-[#12233C] relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Chapter Tag -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 reveal-fade">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#EA6B1F] bg-orange-100/70 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
        Chapter 01
      </span>
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#5B6B7F] uppercase tracking-wider">
        The Summer Shock
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Story text -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6 reveal-fade">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-medium leading-tight text-[#0F2540]">
          Every May in Varanasi, the meter spins faster. And nobody asked if you could afford it.
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#5B6B7F] leading-relaxed">
          If you live in Varanasi, Mirzapur, Prayagraj, or anywhere across Purvanchal, you already know the drill. The temperature hits 44°C. The ceiling fans feel like hairdryers. You switch on the cooler or AC because your family has to sleep.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#5B6B7F] leading-relaxed">
          Then the bill slips under the front door. Last year it was ₹4,500. This year it's ₹7,800. Next year? Unit tariffs go up, fuel surcharges get added, and peak summer slabs kick in. You didn't use double the power — the rates just quietly crept up.
        </p>

        <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#E4E2DA] shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[#0F2540] font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-red-500 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>The uncomfortable truth:</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#5B6B7F] leading-relaxed">
            Renting electricity from the grid is the only monthly expense that is guaranteed to grow every single year of your life, leaving you with zero equity.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Visual Rising-Cost Chart Card -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 reveal-fade">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xl border border-[#E4E2DA] relative">
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-6 border-b border-[#E4E2DA]">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider text-red-600">Cost Escalation</span>
              <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-serif font-bold text-[#0F2540] mt-0.5">Average Summer Monthly Bill in Purvanchal</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#5B6B7F] font-mono bg-gray-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded">2020 – 2026</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Comparative Rising Bar Chart -->
          <div class="mt-8 space-y-6">
            
            <!-- 2020 -->
            <div>
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium mb-1.5">
                <span class="text-[#5B6B7F]">Summer 2020</span>
                <span class="text-[#12233C] font-semibold">₹3,200 / mo</span>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full h-4 bg-gray-100 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                <div class="h-full bg-blue-300 rounded-full" style="width: 35%"></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2022 -->
            <div>
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium mb-1.5">
                <span class="text-[#5B6B7F]">Summer 2022</span>
                <span class="text-[#12233C] font-semibold">₹4,800 / mo</span>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full h-4 bg-gray-100 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                <div class="h-full bg-blue-400 rounded-full" style="width: 52%"></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2024 -->
            <div>
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium mb-1.5">
                <span class="text-[#5B6B7F]">Summer 2024</span>
                <span class="text-[#12233C] font-semibold">₹6,900 / mo</span>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full h-4 bg-gray-100 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                <div class="h-full bg-[#EA6B1F] rounded-full" style="width: 74%"></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2026 Today / Projected -->
            <div>
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium mb-1.5">
                <span class="text-[#0F2540] font-bold">2026 (Now)</span>
                <span class="text-red-600 font-bold">₹9,400+ / mo</span>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full h-4 bg-gray-100 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                <div class="h-full bg-red-500 rounded-full" style="width: 95%"></div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- Comparison footer pill -->
          <div class="mt-8 p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0">
                ✓
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide font-bold text-emerald-800 block">With Wave Power Solar</span>
                <span class="text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-emerald-950">Fixed near ₹0 monthly electricity bill</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="hidden sm:inline-block text-xs font-mono text-emerald-700 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded shadow-sm border border-emerald-100">
              Locked for 25 yrs
            </span>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
